{"id":"conv_04164","context":"A uni student presents a thesis outline to his sociology teacher","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["ren_uni","asuka_teacher"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Professor, for my thesis topic, I'd like to write about Japanese society under the occupation.","jp":"先生、卒論のテーマなんですが、占領下の日本社会について書きたいと考えています。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,6,9,14,17,18,21,26,62,63,75,156,228,318,376,604,632,4858,5804,7885,9154,10213,13968],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"卒論","r":"そつろん","w":13968},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"テーマ","w":604},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"占領","r":"せんりょう","w":4858},{"s":"下","r":"か","w":376},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"日本","r":"にっぽん","w":63},{"s":"社会","r":"しゃかい","w":156},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"書き","r":"かき","w":632},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"考え","r":"かんがえ","w":318},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Sounds interesting. Specifically, which aspect are you planning to focus on?","jp":"面白そうね。具体的にはどの側面に重点を置くつもり?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,5,34,51,61,272,639,871,926,2950,3393,3413,4842,12471],"jpTokens":[{"s":"面白","r":"おもしろ","w":871},{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"具体","r":"ぐたい","w":639},{"s":"的","r":"てき","w":34},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"どの","w":272},{"s":"側面","r":"そくめん","w":3393},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"重点","r":"じゅうてん","w":4842},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"置く","r":"おく","w":2950},{"s":"つもり","w":926},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I'd like to analyze the relationship between women's associations in rural areas and postwar democratization.","jp":"農村地域における婦人会の活動と、戦後の民主化の関係を分析したいです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,5,9,17,19,62,112,123,143,275,288,413,873,1623,2136,3589,4781,4870,4881,10583,11969],"jpTokens":[{"s":"農村","r":"のうそん","w":4870},{"s":"地域","r":"ちいき","w":